    "conversionStatement": "The in-scope source file is the Markdown conversion of the Blades in the Dark SRD text published by Randy Oest (amazingrando) at https://github.com/amazingrando/blades-in-the-dark-srd-content, file Blades-in-the-Dark-SRD.md at commit ac2747ffc0806b2be9f14d29b2ace5dca6149bc3 (2022-04-08), retrieved on 2026-08-24.",
